{
  "_about": "Development agents (DEC-0068/0069, docs/DEV_ECOSYSTEM_AUDIT.md section 7): each role is a provider, a model and a permission tier. Edit freely: roles are configuration, not code. Tiers: read, propose, experiment, review (approve is Zac's only, deploy isn't given to agents). core/work_agents.py checks them. Providers sign in with Zac's own accounts on this PC (claude, codex login, gh auth login); no key is ever kept here.",
